{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>上水警署有警員開槍自殺案件。上水警署今早（26日）10時許傳出槍聲，一名30餘歲男警當值期間，於警署2樓洗手間廁格內懷疑吞槍自盡。救援人員到場，並於10時37分證實警員當場身亡。</p>\n<p>據悉，男事主30多歲，駐守交通部，事發時頭部受傷，身旁有佩槍。</p>\n<h2>防止自殺求助熱線</h2>\n<p>「情緒通」精神健康支援熱線及WhatsApp：18111</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T05:21:08.227453+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T04:40:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T18:17:53.321137+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T05:14:32.844277+00:00","content_hash":"4d505bd81770151a30a22c8558f00b270e5f543f6bafe89fdd8c80ee982f1db3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T05:21:08.227453+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}